OL,3,GNEWSALondon Stadium says hosting more
OL,4,Agigs is 'vital'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon Stadium says it has lost out on
OL,7,Fbids to host artists such as Jay-Z,
OL,8,FHarry Styles and Bad Bunny because of
OL,9,Fplanning restrictions.
OL,11,FThe stadium, in Stratford, east London,
OL,12,Fhas applied for planning permission to
OL,13,Fhost more concerts, with louder noise
OL,14,Flimits and larger attendances, to
OL,15,F"compete with other major venues" that
OL,16,Fit said it was otherwise struggling to
OL,17,Fdo.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
