OL,3,GNEWSALondon Stadium says hosting more
OL,4,Agigs is 'vital'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon Stadium 185 (LS185) ` which
OL,7,Fmanages the venue ` wants Newham
OL,8,FCouncil to approve the application as
OL,9,Fpart of a plan to offset financial
OL,10,Flosses of #19m.
OL,12,FA statement included with its planning
OL,13,Fapplication says these limits "are
OL,14,Fincreasingly restrictive, inhibiting
OL,15,FLS185's ability to compete with other
OL,16,Fmajor London venues".
